{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOL","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"約珥書","commonName":"約珥書","title":"約珥書","order":29,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"b7dcc5db4dcd3ce09a891b7715e7031d7b27bfe3dc62d09644d1c538a20dd57e","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOL/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOL/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":73},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華審判的日子"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["你們要在錫安吹響號角，",{"text":"在我的聖山上發出警訊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"此地的居民都要顫抖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華的日子將要來臨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"已經近了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那是昏暗陰沉的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是烏雲密佈的日子。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"來了一支空前絕後、強盛無比的大軍，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牠們像曙光一樣佈滿山嶺。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"牠們前面有燎原之火，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"後面有熊熊烈焰。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牠們到來之前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地就像伊甸園；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牠們過去之後，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地變成荒涼的曠野。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地上的一切都逃不過這一場浩劫。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"牠們的形狀像馬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"疾馳如戰馬，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在山嶺上跳躍奔騰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如隆隆戰車，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"好像烈火吞噬乾草的聲音，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如大軍列陣備戰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"百姓一看到牠們，就驚慌失措，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"面如死灰。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牠們快速奔跑像勇士，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"攀登城牆如戰士，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有條不紊地前進。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"隊伍整齊，各行其道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"長驅直入，勢不可擋。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"牠們衝向城邑，躥上城牆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"爬進房屋，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如盜賊般破窗而入。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"所到之處，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天搖地動，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"日月昏暗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"星辰無光。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華向祂的軍隊發號施令，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的隊伍不計其數，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"執行祂命令的是勁旅。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華的日子偉大而可畏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"誰能承受得住呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["呼籲人民悔改"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「現在你們要禁食、哭泣、哀號，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全心回轉歸向我。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要撕心般地痛悔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而不是撕裂衣服。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"歸向你們的上帝耶和華吧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為祂有恩典、好憐憫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不輕易發怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"充滿慈愛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不忍心降災禍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"或許祂轉念心生憐憫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"給你們留下祝福，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你們可以再次向你們的上帝耶和華獻上素祭和奠祭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有誰知道呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"要在錫安山吹響號角，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"宣佈禁食的聖日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"舉行莊嚴的聚會。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要招聚老人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"聚集孩童和吃奶的嬰兒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要吩咐新郎出洞房、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"新娘出內室；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要召集全體人民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓會眾潔淨自己。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"讓事奉耶和華的祭司站在聖殿門廊和祭壇中間，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哭泣懇求說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「耶和華啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"求你顧惜你的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不要讓外族人侮辱、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"譏笑你的產業說，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"『他們的上帝在哪裡呢？』」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["再賜祝福"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"text":"耶和華篤愛祂的土地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂憐憫自己的子民。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂回應他們說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「我必賜五穀、新酒和橄欖油給你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你們飽足，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再讓你們受列國的羞辱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使北方的軍隊遠離你們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把他們驅逐到一個乾旱荒蕪的地方，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把他們的領頭部隊趕進死海，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再把他們的殿後部隊趕進地中海，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時他們必臭氣沖天、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惡味上騰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華為你們行了大事。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"土地啊，不要害怕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"倒要歡喜快樂；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華行了大事。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"田野的走獸啊，不要害怕，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為青草鋪遍了曠野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"樹木也結滿了果子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無花果樹和葡萄樹都結實纍纍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"錫安的人民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要快樂，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你們的上帝耶和華而喜樂。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為祂按時","poem":1},{"noteId":1},{"text":"降下甘霖，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像從前一樣賜給你們秋雨和","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"春雨。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"麥場必堆滿五穀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"酒槽裡的酒和油槽裡的油必滿溢。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"text":"「我派蝻蟲、蚱蜢、螞蚱","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"和蝗蟲大軍在那些年所吃掉的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要補償你們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們必吃得飽足，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並讚美你們的上帝耶和華的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因祂為你們行了奇事。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民永遠不會再蒙羞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這樣，你們就知道我在以色列，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"知道我是你們的上帝耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除我以外別無他神。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民永遠不會再蒙羞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"text":"「以後，我要將我的靈澆灌所有的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們的兒女要說預言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"老人要做異夢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"青年要見異象。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在那些日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要將我的靈澆灌我的奴僕和婢女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":["「我要在天上地下行奇事，你們將看見血、火和煙柱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":["太陽要變得昏暗，月亮要變得血紅。在耶和華偉大而可畏的日子來臨以前，這些事都會發生。"]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":["那時候，凡求告耶和華之名的人都必得救，因為在錫安山，在耶路撒冷城，必有逃脫災難的人，耶和華所呼召的人必倖存下來，正如耶和華所言。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"「按時」希伯來文是「按公義」。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":23}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOL/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOL/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JOL/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":32}